  "regular-body": "<p>The controller for some of the LED strips in the space needed a new case, so we grabbed this old UPS case from the pile and hooked up the front panel LEDs alongside the LED strips to make them blink as well ✨</p><figure class=\"tmblr-full\" data-orig-height=\"1080\" data-orig-width=\"1920\" data-npf='{\"type\":\"video\",\"provider\":\"tumblr\",\"url\":\"https://va.media.tumblr.com/tumblr_qs491i5tK31ts6fym_720.mp4\",\"media\":{\"url\":\"https://va.media.tumblr.com/tumblr_qs491i5tK31ts6fym_720.mp4\",\"type\":\"video/mp4\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080},\"poster\":[{\"url\":\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/tumblr_qs491i5tK31ts6fym_frame1.jpg\",\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080}],\"filmstrip\":{\"url\":\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/previews/tumblr_qs491i5tK31ts6fym_filmstrip.jpg\",\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"width\":2000,\"height\":112},\"duration\":28}'><video controls=\"controls\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" playsinline=\"playsinline\" muted=\"muted\" poster=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/tumblr_qs491i5tK31ts6fym_frame1.jpg\"><source src=\"https://va.media.tumblr.com/tumblr_qs491i5tK31ts6fym_720.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></source></video></figure>",
